Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 01:52:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] SessionManager: remember open sessions and offer to
 restore them

Open sessions are saved per host in tab order. After a restart the panel
offers to reopen the ones that still exist, and Open All brings back every
session of a host.
